  "question": {
    "text": "If the variance of the first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> natural numbers is <math><mn>10</mn></math> and the variance of the first <math><mi>m</mi></math> even natural numbers is <math><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi></math> then the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
